{"diagnosis": "Fetch makes no progress with max_addr stuck at 0x00000000 (FAIL 0xdead, TRAP: no progress). Expected reset to leave mem_state idle (0) with mem_valid low so case mem_state 0 can issue mem_do_prefetch/mem_do_rinst/mem_do_rdata. Root cause in excerpt at line 568 is reset forces mem_state <= 1 with mem_valid <= 0, so the machine starts in the wait state waiting for mem_ready that never comes and the first fetch is never issued.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -565,8 +565,8 @@
 	always @(posedge clk) begin
 		if (!resetn || trap) begin
 			if (!resetn)
- 				mem_state <= 1;
+ 				mem_state <= 0;
 			if (!resetn || mem_ready)
 				mem_valid <= 0;
 			mem_la_secondword <= 0;", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead), no TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000, max_addr advances beyond 0x00000000"}

